{"page":293,"verses":[{"verse_key":"17:105","surah":17,"ayah":105,"ar_uthmani":"وَبِٱلْحَقِّ أَنزَلْنَـٰهُ وَبِٱلْحَقِّ نَزَلَ ۗ وَمَآ أَرْسَلْنَـٰكَ إِلَّا مُبَشِّرًا وَنَذِيرًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We sent down the Quran with the truth, and with the truth it has come down- [Prophet], We sent you only to give good news and warning-","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَبِٱلْحَقِّ","en_gloss":"And with the truth","transliteration":"wabil-ḥaqi","verse_key":"17:105"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَنزَلْنَـٰهُ","en_gloss":"We sent it down","transliteration":"anzalnāhu","verse_key":"17:105"},{"pos":3,"ar":"وَبِٱلْحَقِّ","en_gloss":"and with the truth","transliteration":"wabil-ḥaqi","verse_key":"17:105"},{"pos":4,"ar":"نَزَلَ ۗ","en_gloss":"it descended","transliteration":"nazala","verse_key":"17:105"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَمَآ","en_gloss":"And not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"17:105"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أَرْسَلْنَـٰكَ","en_gloss":"We sent you","transliteration":"arsalnāka","verse_key":"17:105"},{"pos":7,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"17:105"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مُبَشِّرًۭا","en_gloss":"(as) a bearer of glad tidings","transliteration":"mubashiran","verse_key":"17:105"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَنَذِيرًۭا","en_gloss":"and a warner","transliteration":"wanadhīran","verse_key":"17:105"},{"pos":10,"ar":"١٠٥","en_gloss":"(105)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"17:105"}]},{"verse_key":"17:106","surah":17,"ayah":106,"ar_uthmani":"وَقُرْءَانًا فَرَقْنَـٰهُ لِتَقْرَأَهُۥ عَلَى ٱلنَّاسِ عَلَىٰ مُكْثٍ وَنَزَّلْنَـٰهُ تَنزِيلًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"it is a recitation that We have revealed in parts, so that you can recite it to people at intervals; We have sent it down little by little.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَقُرْءَانًۭا","en_gloss":"And the Quran","transliteration":"waqur'ānan","verse_key":"17:106"},{"pos":2,"ar":"فَرَقْنَـٰهُ","en_gloss":"We have divided","transliteration":"faraqnāhu","verse_key":"17:106"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لِتَقْرَأَهُۥ","en_gloss":"that y